## 2. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

### Role Hierarchy

```
SuperAdmin (you)
├── Full system control
├── Create/manage departments
├── Create/manage department admins
├── View all data across departments
├── System configuration
└── Audit log access

Department Admin (e.g., Police, Revenue, Health)
├── Manage services within their department
├── View/handle grievances routed to their department
├── View/handle feedback for their department
├── Manage department employees/posts
└── View department-level analytics

(Future: Department Staff)
├── View-only access to department data
├── Update grievance/feedback status
└── Cannot create/delete services
```

### Permission Matrix

| Action | SuperAdmin | Dept Admin | Public |
|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| Create departments | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Create/manage admins | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Assign admins to departments | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Create services (any dept) | ✅ | Own dept only | ❌ |
| Edit services | ✅ | Own dept only | ❌ |
| Publish services | ✅ | Own dept only | ❌ |
| View all grievances | ✅ | Own dept only | Own (via tracking) |
| Handle grievances | ✅ | Own dept only | ❌ |
| View all feedbacks | ✅ | Own dept only | ❌ |
| Delete data | ✅ | Own dept (restricted) | ❌ |
| View analytics | ✅ (global) | Own dept | ❌ |
| Access audit logs | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| System settings | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Submit grievance/feedback | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| View published services | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

