## 6. Frontend Overhaul

### 6.1 Security Fixes

```
Frontend Security:
├── ☐ Remove all console.log from API client
├── ☐ Move token to httpOnly cookie (no more localStorage)
├── ☐ Add CSRF token header to all mutations
├── ☐ Sanitize all user-displayed content (DOMPurify)
├── ☐ Add Content Security Policy meta tag
└── ☐ Remove /admin/register page (admin creation via SuperAdmin only)
```

### 6.2 New Pages Needed

```
SuperAdmin Dashboard:
├── /admin                         — Dashboard home (role-aware)
├── /admin/departments             — Department management
├── /admin/departments/:id         — Department detail + stats
├── /admin/users                   — Admin user management
├── /admin/users/create            — Create department admin
├── /admin/audit-logs              — System audit trail
├── /admin/system-settings         — Global config
└── /admin/analytics               — Cross-department analytics

Department Admin Dashboard:
├── /admin                         — Dashboard home (dept-scoped)
├── /admin/my-department           — Department overview
├── /admin/grievances              — Dept grievances (filtered)
├── /admin/feedbacks               — Dept feedbacks (filtered)
├── /admin/services                — Dept services
└── /admin/team                    — Dept team members

Public Pages (enhanced):
├── /grievances-service            — Add department selector
├── /feedback-service              — Add department selector
└── /track/:trackingId             — Grievance tracking (dedicated)
```

### 6.3 Auth Context Upgrade

```typescript
// Enhanced AuthContext
interface AuthContextType {
  admin: Admin | null;
  isLoading: boolean;
  isSuperAdmin: boolean;         // NEW
  isDepartmentAdmin: boolean;    // NEW
  department: Department | null; // NEW
  permissions: string[];         // NEW
  login: (email: string, password: string) => Promise<void>;
  logout: () => void;
  isAuthenticated: boolean;
}
```

### 6.4 Route Guards

```typescript
// Role-based route protection
<Route element={<RequireAuth />}>                     {/* Any admin */}
  <Route element={<RequireSuperAdmin />}>             {/* SuperAdmin only */}
    <Route path="/admin/departments" ... />
    <Route path="/admin/users" ... />
    <Route path="/admin/audit-logs" ... />
  </Route>
  <Route element={<RequireDepartmentAccess />}>       {/* Dept-scoped */}
    <Route path="/admin/grievances" ... />
    <Route path="/admin/services" ... />
  </Route>
</Route>
```

