## 8. Additional Features for Production

### 8.1 Essential Government Platform Features

| Feature | Priority | Description |
|---|:---:|---|
| **Email Notifications** | P0 | Notify citizens on grievance status changes, notify admins on new submissions |
| **SMS Integration** | P0 | Many users won't have email. Integrate Twilio/MSG91 for SMS updates |
| **SLA Management** | P0 | Auto-set resolution deadlines per priority: Urgent=24h, High=3d, Medium=7d, Low=14d. Dashboard shows SLA breaches. |
| **Grievance Escalation** | P0 | Auto-escalate to SuperAdmin if SLA breached. Dept admin can manually escalate. |
| **File Attachments** | P1 | Proper file upload with virus scanning, type validation, and S3 storage for grievance evidence |
| **Dashboard Analytics** | P1 | Charts: grievances by dept, resolution time, SLA compliance, service usage, feedback trends |
| **Search & Filter** | P1 | Full-text search on grievances/services. Filter by date range, department, status, priority |
| **Export to PDF/Excel** | P1 | Export grievance reports, service listings, analytics for government reporting |
| **Bilingual Support (English/Bengali)** | P1 | i18n framework. Bengali translations for all public-facing pages |
| **Accessibility (WCAG 2.1)** | P1 | Government websites must be accessible. Screen reader support, keyboard nav, high contrast |
| **Print-Friendly Views** | P2 | Print grievance receipts, service details, certificates |
| **Announcement System** | P2 | SuperAdmin can post public announcements/notices |
| **FAQ/Knowledge Base** | P2 | Reduce grievance load by providing self-service answers |
| **Citizen Portal** | P3 | Optional citizen account to track all their submissions in one place |

### 8.2 Admin Experience Improvements

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Real-time Notifications** | WebSocket-based bell icon showing new grievances/feedbacks |
| **Bulk Operations** | Select multiple grievances → assign, change status, export |
| **Canned Responses** | Pre-written response templates for common grievance resolutions |
| **Internal Notes** | Admin-only notes on grievances visible to other admins but not citizens |
| **Assignment Queue** | Auto-assign grievances round-robin among department admins |
| **Activity Timeline** | Per-grievance history log: who changed what, when |
| **Dashboard Widgets** | Customizable widgets: pending count, SLA breach count, recent activity |

### 8.3 Compliance & Legal

| Requirement | Action |
|---|---|
| **Data Protection** | Encrypt PII fields, implement data retention policies |
| **Right to Information (RTI)** | Ensure audit trails are immutable |
| **Government IT Guidelines** | Follow MeitY guidelines for government websites |
| **Backup & Recovery** | Daily automated backups, tested restore procedure |
| **Disaster Recovery** | Multi-AZ deployment, <4 hour RTO |

