## 9. Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Security Hardening (Week 1-2) 🔴
> Must complete before ANY public deployment

```
☐ 1.1  Fix open registration (restrict to SuperAdmin)
☐ 1.2  Add authenticateAdmin to grievance/feedback admin routes
☐ 1.3  Remove hardcoded JWT fallbacks (fail if missing)
☐ 1.4  Delete dead code (mockAuth, simpleAuth, testAuth, demo, *_new files)
☐ 1.5  Fix duplicate route mounting
☐ 1.6  Add helmet middleware
☐ 1.7  Add rate limiting (express-rate-limit + redis store)
☐ 1.8  Sanitize error responses
☐ 1.9  Remove verbose logging / replace with structured logger
☐ 1.10 Create singleton PrismaClient
☐ 1.11 Add input sanitization (express-validator + custom XSS filter)
☐ 1.12 Strengthen password policy
☐ 1.13 Remove frontend console.log statements
☐ 1.14 Add .env.example files (with placeholder values, not real secrets)
```

### Phase 2: RBAC + Departments (Week 2-4) 🟠
> Core architectural change

```
☐ 2.1  Add Department model to Prisma schema
☐ 2.2  Add departmentId to Admin, Grievance, Feedback, all Service models
☐ 2.3  Add AuditLog model
☐ 2.4  Add Session model (for token revocation)
☐ 2.5  Create SuperAdmin seed script (first SuperAdmin created via CLI)
☐ 2.6  Build department CRUD routes
☐ 2.7  Build admin management routes (SuperAdmin only)
☐ 2.8  Implement role-based middleware (requireSuperAdmin, requireDeptAdmin)
☐ 2.9  Add departmentId scoping to all existing routes
☐ 2.10 Implement audit logging middleware
☐ 2.11 Update frontend AuthContext with role/department awareness
☐ 2.12 Build SuperAdmin dashboard pages
☐ 2.13 Build Department Admin dashboard pages
☐ 2.14 Add department selector to grievance/feedback submission forms
☐ 2.15 Implement route guards on frontend
☐ 2.16 Run Prisma migration
```

### Phase 3: Auth Overhaul (Week 4-5) 🟠
> Proper session management

```
☐ 3.1  Implement refresh token flow (httpOnly cookies)
☐ 3.2  Remove localStorage token storage from frontend
☐ 3.3  Build session management (login creates session, logout deletes)
☐ 3.4  Account lockout after failed attempts
☐ 3.5  Remove /admin/register page (replaced by SuperAdmin admin creation)
☐ 3.6  Add "Manage Sessions" page for admins (see active sessions, revoke)
☐ 3.7  Short-lived access tokens (15 min) + refresh rotation
```

### Phase 4: Scalability (Week 5-7) 🟡
> Prepare for 4M users

```
☐ 4.1  Set up Redis caching layer
☐ 4.2  Add database indexes per schema above
☐ 4.3  Implement PgBouncer connection pooling
☐ 4.4  Add response caching for public endpoints
☐ 4.5  Optimize Prisma queries (eliminate N+1, add select)
☐ 4.6  Set up BullMQ for async jobs (emails, notifications)
☐ 4.7  Implement CDN for frontend assets
☐ 4.8  Load testing with k6/Artillery (target: 1000 concurrent users)
☐ 4.9  Set up monitoring (Prometheus metrics endpoint)
☐ 4.10 Configure production PostgreSQL (tuning, read replicas)
```

### Phase 5: Feature Completion (Week 7-10) 🟡
> Production features

```
☐ 5.1  Email notification service (nodemailer + templates)
☐ 5.2  SMS notification integration
☐ 5.3  SLA management engine (auto-deadline, breach alerts)
☐ 5.4  Grievance escalation flow
☐ 5.5  File upload to S3 with type validation
☐ 5.6  Dashboard analytics (charts, graphs)
