## 10. Deployment Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Public Internet"
        U[4M Citizens]
        A[Admin Users]
    end

    subgraph "CDN Layer"
        CF[Cloudflare/CloudFront]
    end

    subgraph "Load Balancer"
        LB[Nginx / ALB]
    end

    subgraph "Application Tier"
        API1[API Server 1]
        API2[API Server 2]
        API3[API Server 3]
        WS[WebSocket Server]
    end

    subgraph "Cache Layer"
        R[Redis Cluster]
        BQ[BullMQ Workers]
    end

    subgraph "Database Tier"
        PG["PostgreSQL Primary"]
        PGR["PostgreSQL Read Replica"]
        PGB[PgBouncer]
    end

    subgraph "Storage"
        S3[S3 / MinIO]
    end

    subgraph "External Services"
        EM[Email Service - SES/SMTP]
        SM[SMS Gateway - MSG91]
    end

    subgraph "Monitoring"
        PR[Prometheus]
        GR[Grafana]
        LOG[ELK / CloudWatch]
    end

    U --> CF
    A --> CF
    CF --> LB
    LB --> API1
    LB --> API2
    LB --> API3
    LB --> WS

    API1 --> PGB
    API2 --> PGB
    API3 --> PGB
    API1 --> R
    API2 --> R
    API3 --> R
    API1 --> S3
    WS --> R

    PGB --> PG
    PGB --> PGR

    BQ --> R
    BQ --> EM
    BQ --> SM
    BQ --> PGB

    API1 --> PR
    API2 --> PR
    API3 --> PR
    PR --> GR
    API1 --> LOG
```

